<title>UK: BTR profits decline in year.</title>
<headline>BTR profits decline in year.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		21.7		   vs 24.9</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 9.6		    vs 14.690</p>
<p> Equivalent FID (pence) 12.00		  vs 16.075</p>
<p> Pretax		     1.30 bln	     vs 1.50 bln</p>
<p> Turnover		   8.4 bln		vs 7.6 bln</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 728 million and 1.25 bln stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - BTR Plc.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
